Statement of Purpose

The laws of most jurisdictions throughout the world automatically confer
exclusive Copyright and Related Rights upon the creator and subsequent
owner(s) of an original work of authorship and/or a database. These
rights are intended to give the original creator control over the use of
the work.

To the greatest extent permitted by and consistent with applicable law,
the dedicator hereby overtly, fully, permanently, irrevocably and
unconditionally waives, abandons, and surrenders all of the dedicator's
Copyright and Related Rights and associated claims and causes of action,
for the benefit of each member of the public at large.

